    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>奇物，非普通</em></p><p>这副由象牙或牛皮纸而制成的纸牌以 <strong>万象无常牌Deck of Many Things</strong> 的形象为原型而制作，可为使用它的人带来各种小好处和惩罚。大多数（75%）牌组只有13张牌，其余的则有22张牌。</p><p>抽卡之前，你必须先声明要抽多少张卡牌，然后随机抽取（你可以使用扑克牌模拟牌组）。继续抽取声明数量之外更多的卡牌将不会产生任何效应。按正常方法抽出的卡牌其魔法效应在抽出时立即生效。你抽取两张卡牌之间的间隔不能超过1小时。如果你未能抽够声明数量的卡牌，声明了但是未抽取的那部分卡牌将从牌组中自行飞出并同时生效。除非你抽到的是神秘 Mystery卡，否则抽出的卡型将立刻生效，消失，然后重新出现在牌组里，使得你可能再次抽到该卡。</p><p>你可以使用一副经过改良的扑克牌来模拟这副牌组，如 \"奇迹牌组 \"表所示。</p><table data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Deck of Wonder\" class=\"w-100 stripe-odd-table\"><caption><strong>奇迹牌组</strong></caption><thead><tr><th data-rd-isroller=\"true\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">[[/r 1d22]]{扑克牌}</th><th data-rd-isroller=\"false\" class=\"ve-col-8\">卡牌</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-roll-min=\"1\" data-roll-max=\"1\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">A <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Chancellor|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"2\" data-roll-max=\"2\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">K <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Day|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"3\" data-roll-max=\"3\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">Q <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Night|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"4\" data-roll-max=\"4\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">J <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Dawn|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"5\" data-roll-max=\"5\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">2 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Dusk|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"6\" data-roll-max=\"6\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">A <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Destiny|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"7\" data-roll-max=\"7\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">K <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Crown|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"8\" data-roll-max=\"8\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">Q <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Lock|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"9\" data-roll-max=\"9\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">J <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Champion|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"10\" data-roll-max=\"10\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">2 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Coin|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"11\" data-roll-max=\"11\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">A ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Vulture|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"12\" data-roll-max=\"12\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">K ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Chaos|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"13\" data-roll-max=\"13\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">Q ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Order|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"14\" data-roll-max=\"14\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">J ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Beginning|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"15\" data-roll-max=\"15\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">2 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Mystery|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"16\" data-roll-max=\"16\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">A ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Isolation|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"17\" data-roll-max=\"17\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">K ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[End|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"18\" data-roll-max=\"18\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">Q ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Monster|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"19\" data-roll-max=\"19\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">J ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Knife|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"20\" data-roll-max=\"20\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">2 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Justice|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"21\" data-roll-max=\"21\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">Joker (with ™)</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Student|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"22\" data-roll-max=\"22\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">Joker (without ™)</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Mischief|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>开始 Beginning。</h3><p>你的当前生命值及其上限增加[[/r 2d10]]，以这种方式增加生命值上限的效应持续8小时。</p><h3>勇士 Champion。</h3><p>你的武器攻击和伤害掷骰获得+1加值。该增益持续8小时。</p><h3>大臣 Chancellor。</h3><p>在抽到此卡后的8小时内，你可以用动作施展一次<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.umqpL5B9ccbkpJtJ]{卜筮术 Augury}</em>  ，且无需材料成分。使用智力、感知、或魅力作为施法属性（由你选择）。</p><h3>混沌 Chaos。</h3><p>你获得下列中的一种伤害抗性（由DM选择）：强酸、寒冷、火焰、闪电、雷鸣。此抗性持续[[/r 1d12]]日。</p><h3>硬币 Coin。</h3><p>五件珠宝（每件价值100gp），或十颗宝石（每颗价值50gp），出现在你脚边。</p><h3>皇冠 Crown。</h3><p>你习得戏法<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.JqyWE42E4J9IR1au]{交友术 friends}</em>。使用智力、感知、或魅力作为施法属性（由你选择）。如果你已知该戏法，此卡没有效果。</p><h3>黎明 Dawn。</h3><p>这张牌能让你精神振奋。在接下来的8小时内，你可以将你的熟练加值加入你的先攻检定中。</p><h3>白昼 Day。</h3><p>你的豁免检定获得+1加值。该增益持续到你完成一次长休为止。</p><h3>宿命 Destiny。</h3><p>这张卡可以保护你避免过早死亡。抽到此卡后，你首次因受到伤害而生命值降为0时，你改为降至1点生命值。</p><h3>黄昏 Dusk。</h3><p>这张牌会超自然地消耗你的能量。你进行的先攻检定具有劣势。此效果会持续到你完成一次长休为止，不过它可以被<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.ewDH2w8w2yLSM021]{移除诅咒 Remove Curse}</em>或类似的魔法提前终止。</p><h3>结束 End。</h3><p>这张牌是死亡的预兆。你受到[[/damage 2d10 type=necrotic]]伤害，并且你的生命值上限会降低，降低的程度等同你受到的伤害（该效果无法将你的生命值上限降至10以下），该减损持续到你完成一次长休。但它可以被<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.ewDH2w8w2yLSM021]{移除诅咒 Remove Curse}</em>或类似的魔法提前终止。</p><h3>隔离 isolation。</h3><p>你和你所穿戴或携带的任何东西一起消失，并被困在一个无害的超次元空间中[[/r 1d4]]分钟。你不能再抽牌。之后你重新出现在你之前所在的空间或最近的未占据空间。当你再次出现时，你必须成功通过一次[[/save ability=con dc=11]]豁免，否则你的身体因在次元旅行中摇摆而陷入 中毒Poisoned 状态1小时。</p><h3>正义Justice。</h3><p>你暂时获得了平衡命运天平的能力。在接下来的8小时内，每当你或你周围60尺内的生物即将投出具有优势或劣势的[[/r d20]]时，你可以用你的反应来防止该次投掷受到优势或劣势的影响。</p><h3>刀刃 Knife。</h3><p>一把你熟练的、非普通稀有度的魔法武器出现在你的手中。具体武器由DM选择。</p><h3>枷锁 Lock。</h3><p>你获得[[/r 1d3]]次施展<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.VC9nFuUxF7yptXK5]{敲击术 Knock}</em>的能力。使用你的智力、感知、或魅力作为施法属性（由你选择）。</p><h3>恶戏 Mischief。</h3><p>你收到一件非普通魔法物品（由DM选择），或者你在声明的抽卡数量外再额外抽两张卡牌。</p><h3>怪物 Monster。</h3><p>这张卡的怪物面容诅咒了你。以这种方式被诅咒期间，每当你进行一次豁免时，你必须投掷一颗[[/r 1d4]]，并从结果中减去掷出的数值。诅咒会持续到你完成一次长休，但它可以被<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.ewDH2w8w2yLSM021]{移除诅咒 Remove Curse}</em>或类似的魔法提前终止。</p><h3>神秘 Mystery。</h3><p>接下来的1小时内，你进行的智力豁免具有劣势。弃掉这张牌并再从牌组中抽一张牌：这两张抽牌仅视为你声明的抽牌数量中的“一次”。</p><h3>黑夜 Night。</h3><p>你获得300尺黑暗视觉，持续8小时。</p><h3>秩序 Order。</h3><p>你获得下列中的一种伤害抗性（由DM选择）：力场、暗蚀、毒素、心灵、光耀。这种抗性持续[[/r 1d12]]日。</p><h3>学徒 Student。</h3><p>你获得感知豁免的熟练项，若你已拥有此熟练项，你改为获得智力或魅力豁免熟练项（由你选择）。</p><h3>秃鹫 Vulture。</h3><p>你所拥有的一件非魔法物品或装备（由DM选择）消失。该物品会停留在附近，但会隐藏一小段时间，通过一次[[/save ability=wis dc=15]] (察觉)检定后即可被发现。如果该物品在1小时内未被找回。它将永远消失。</p><p>Created in the image of the Deck of Many Things, this deck of ivory or vellum cards bestows an assortment of minor benefits and penalties on those who draw from it. Most (75 percent) of these decks have only thirteen cards, but the rest have twenty-two.</p><p>Before you draw a card, you must declare how many cards you intend to draw, then draw them randomly. Any additional cards drawn have no effect. Unless a card states otherwise, as soon as you draw a card from the deck, its magic takes effect. You must draw each card you declared no more than 1 hour after the previous draw. If you fail to draw the chosen number, the remaining number of cards fly from the deck and take effect simultaneously.</p><p>Unless it is the Mystery card, a drawn card immediately takes effect, fades from existence, and reappears in the deck, making it possible to draw the same card multiple times.</p><p>You can use an altered deck of playing cards to simulate the deck, as shown in the <em>Deck of Wonder</em> table.</p><table data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Deck of Wonder\" class=\"w-100 stripe-odd-table\"><caption>Deck of Wonder</caption><thead><tr><th data-rd-isroller=\"true\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">[[/r 1d22]]{Card}</th><th data-rd-isroller=\"false\" class=\"ve-col-8\">Card Title</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-roll-min=\"1\" data-roll-max=\"1\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">A <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Chancellor|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"2\" data-roll-max=\"2\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">K <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Day|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"3\" data-roll-max=\"3\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">Q <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Night|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"4\" data-roll-max=\"4\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">J <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Dawn|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"5\" data-roll-max=\"5\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">2 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♦</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Dusk|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"6\" data-roll-max=\"6\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">A <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Destiny|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"7\" data-roll-max=\"7\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">K <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Crown|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"8\" data-roll-max=\"8\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">Q <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Lock|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"9\" data-roll-max=\"9\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">J <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Champion|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"10\" data-roll-max=\"10\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">2 <span style=\"color: #ff0000\">♥</span></td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Coin|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"11\" data-roll-max=\"11\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">A ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Vulture|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"12\" data-roll-max=\"12\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">K ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Chaos|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"13\" data-roll-max=\"13\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">Q ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Order|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"14\" data-roll-max=\"14\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">J ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Beginning|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"15\" data-roll-max=\"15\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">2 ♣</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Mystery|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"16\" data-roll-max=\"16\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">A ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Isolation|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"17\" data-roll-max=\"17\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">K ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[End|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"18\" data-roll-max=\"18\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">Q ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Monster|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"19\" data-roll-max=\"19\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">J ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Knife|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"20\" data-roll-max=\"20\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">2 ♠</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Justice|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"21\" data-roll-max=\"21\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">Joker (with ™)</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Student|Deck of Wonder|BMT]*</td></tr><tr><td data-roll-min=\"22\" data-roll-max=\"22\" class=\"ve-col-4 ve-text-center\">Joker (without ™)</td><td class=\"ve-col-8\">@card[Mischief|Deck of Wonder|BMT]</td></tr></tbody></table><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Beginning\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Beginning.</span> Your hit point maximum and current hit points increase by [[/r 2d10]]. Your hit point maximum remains increased in this way for the next 8 hours.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Champion\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Champion.</span> You gain a +1 bonus to weapon attack and damage rolls. This bonus lasts for 8 hours.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Chancellor\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Chancellor.</span> Within 8 hours of drawing this card, you can cast @spell[Augury] once as an action, requiring no material components. Use your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma as the spellcasting ability (your choice).</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Chaos\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Chaos.</span> You gain resistance to one of the following damage types (chosen by the DM): acid, cold, fire, lightning, or thunder. This resistance lasts for [[/r 1d12]] days.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Coin\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Coin.</span> Five pieces of jewelry, each worth 100 gp, or ten gemstones, each worth 50 gp, appear at your feet.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Crown\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Crown.</span> You learn the @spell[Friends] cantrip. Use your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma as the spellcasting ability (your choice). If you already know this cantrip, the card has no effect.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Dawn\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Dawn.</span> This card invigorates you. For the next 8 hours, you can add your proficiency bonus to your initiative rolls.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Day\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Day.</span> You gain a +1 bonus to saving throws. This benefit lasts until you finish a long rest.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Destiny\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Destiny.</span> This card protects you against an untimely demise. The first time after drawing this card that you would drop to 0 hit points from taking damage, you instead drop to 1 hit point.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Dusk\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Dusk.</span> This card supernaturally saps your energy. You have disadvantage on initiative rolls. This effect lasts until you finish a long rest, but it can be ended early by a @spell[Remove Curse] spell or similar magic.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"End\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">End.</span> This card is an omen of death. You take [[/damage 2d10 type=necrotic]] damage, and your hit point maximum is reduced by an amount equal to the damage taken. This effect can't reduce your hit point maximum below 10 hit points. This reduction lasts until you finish a long rest, but it can be ended early by a @spell[Remove Curse] spell or similar magic.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Isolation\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Isolation.</span> You disappear, along with anything you are wearing or carrying, and become trapped in a harmless extradimensional space for [[/r 1d4]] minutes. You draw no more cards. You then reappear in the space you left or the nearest unoccupied space. When you reappear, you must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=11]] saving throw or have the poisoned condition for 1 hour as your body reels from the extradimensional travel.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Justice\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Justice.</span> You momentarily gain the ability to balance the scales of fate. For the next 8 hours, whenever you or a creature within 60 feet of you is about to roll a [[/r d20]] with advantage or disadvantage, you can use your reaction to prevent the roll from being affected by advantage or disadvantage.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Knife\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Knife.</span> An uncommon magic weapon you're proficient with appears in your hands. The DM chooses the weapon.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Lock\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Lock.</span> You gain the ability to cast @spell[Knock] [[/r 1d3]] times. Use your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma as the spellcasting ability (your choice).</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Mischief\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Mischief.</span> You receive an uncommon wondrous item (chosen by the DM), or you can draw two additional cards beyond your declared draws.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Monster\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Monster.</span> This card's monstrous visage curses you. While cursed in this way, whenever you make a saving throw, you must roll [[/r 1d4]] and subtract the number rolled from the total. The curse lasts until you finish a long rest, but it can be ended early with a @spell[Remove Curse] spell or similar magic.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Mystery\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Mystery.</span> You have disadvantage on Intelligence saving throws for 1 hour. Discard this card and draw from the deck again; together, the two draws count as one of your declared draws.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Night\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Night.</span> You gain &amp;Reference[rule=darkvision] within a range of 300 feet. This &amp;Reference[rule=darkvision] lasts for 8 hours.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Order\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Order.</span> You gain resistance to one of the following damage types (chosen by the DM): force, necrotic, poison, psychic, or radiant. This resistance lasts for [[/r 1d12]] days.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Student\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Student.</span> You gain proficiency in Wisdom saving throws. If you already have this proficiency, you instead gain proficiency in Intelligence or Charisma saving throws (your choice).</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Vulture\"><p><span class=\"entry-title-inner\">Vulture.</span> One nonmagical item or piece of equipment in your possession (chosen by the DM) disappears. The item remains nearby but concealed for a short time, so it can be found with a successful [[/save ability=wis dc=15]] (&amp;Reference[skill=Perception]) check. If the item isn't recovered within 1 hour, it disappears forever.</p></div>",
